  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The newly created chair focusing on the history, literature, and institutions of the United States, which will be shared among various universities in Great Britain, marks a significant departure from the previous exchange professorships that often yielded mixed results.",
      "output_sha256": "ac8ab32f618f6716de9c52f2e01a815aca17f574359226344b4d357bd151ee33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.585088,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "33f9be64081d4cecdc70e90b3f6c5a7d34c3ecd2c05deb7e0ddde29452b061f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac8ab32f618f6716de9c52f2e01a815aca17f574359226344b4d357bd151ee33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not at all the idea to carry over one of our professors each year and indoctrinate him with the true culture at its source.",
      "output_sha256": "45b5c49d2dc2ea8f3cb868a87a76b20cccbf96189f11b964687a542167709fb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "45b5c49d2dc2ea8f3cb868a87a76b20cccbf96189f11b964687a542167709fb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The occupant of the chair will be, if the announced intention is carried out, quite as often British as American, and quite as likely a public man as a professor.",
      "output_sha256": "f6d83a7fdc850bcbd738d9a3104a8b6e8314db95b84adf14d1fac3f12157da81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6d83a7fdc850bcbd738d9a3104a8b6e8314db95b84adf14d1fac3f12157da81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The primary goal is to foster a deeper understanding of the United States in England, and such an aspiration is indeed noble.",
      "output_sha256": "7644559dc3fb2fda5d80794b1f7f81e72fc8b0e5919688684e01fe9bcfc5fa9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.448551,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad26d5d0b262740b43a11d3953eea3bb633be16aeaa3a807d1b126b39f0bbcf6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7644559dc3fb2fda5d80794b1f7f81e72fc8b0e5919688684e01fe9bcfc5fa9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The ongoing peace and prosperity in the world hinges significantly on how well England comprehends America.",
      "output_sha256": "4c8c649ebaa11dd38ed6c7932874947ccc8d8f16acc63e018880b1168efb2f38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.370312,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "68c1ea7df5504ed7ce396979f32cd2eb5280bb90fe8aea64f3f703c4d86d284b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4c8c649ebaa11dd38ed6c7932874947ccc8d8f16acc63e018880b1168efb2f38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is a misconception to believe that American understanding of British culture is on par with British understanding of American life.",
      "output_sha256": "c4a498383ad429aa0ef5654ca98a3206d2b26497c6ab4df284d3e441a07ca76d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.473545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af3bd34df493b075ffc54b408f5554764d74cf5b31d0f0fe3d621a55c7df036c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4a498383ad429aa0ef5654ca98a3206d2b26497c6ab4df284d3e441a07ca76d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The British Empire is a large and comparatively simple fact, now conspicuously before the world for a long time.",
      "output_sha256": "eef5b7d8f758cfc3701effd85a766abd94e31bcfdc0cf875a13fc14c2ebceb33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "eef5b7d8f758cfc3701effd85a766abd94e31bcfdc0cf875a13fc14c2ebceb33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The United States was, in British eyes, until recently, a comparatively insignificant fact, yet vastly more complicated than they imagined.",
      "output_sha256": "b540a4ccf874c5568fcc2545b6a537b04b21fdc614c67345b38d6b890dd8407f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "b540a4ccf874c5568fcc2545b6a537b04b21fdc614c67345b38d6b890dd8407f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Each, of course, perfectly knew the faults of the other, assessed with an unerring cousinly eye.",
      "output_sha256": "b490e4fab8a5f54f7ceaadda3e3fca765f3c7f893fa6b0be8d3111f1b94740dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b490e4fab8a5f54f7ceaadda3e3fca765f3c7f893fa6b0be8d3111f1b94740dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The American bragged in a nasal whine, the Briton patronized in a throaty burble.",
      "output_sha256": "0cad7ed5d576e431abae4be61519f009998ad928a47aa0d8236e38b9065f1962",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "0cad7ed5d576e431abae4be61519f009998ad928a47aa0d8236e38b9065f1962",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Whoever among the struggling nations of the world might win, England saw to it that she never lost; your Yankee was content with the more ignoble triumphs of merchandising, willing to cheapen life if he could only add to his dollars.",
      "output_sha256": "f98c5e7f7f278d2567196384a58807975dc997d548b1a3d19e0d7d8fa69f6f6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "f98c5e7f7f278d2567196384a58807975dc997d548b1a3d19e0d7d8fa69f6f6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the excellence of English political institutions and methods, the charm of English life, the tremendous power of the Empire for promoting freedom and civilization in the world, these are things which Americans have long recognized and in a way understood.",
      "output_sha256": "7dce23bc6d80a72b01568034357acf4fdb353d190a76f80d6d2488d55b9b9628",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "7dce23bc6d80a72b01568034357acf4fdb353d190a76f80d6d2488d55b9b9628",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Anything like an equivalent British appreciation of America in the large seems confined to a very few honorable exceptions among them.",
      "output_sha256": "c19faeacafcd681fc1a5677088a1f984b3e431219648d433ecd05fc413f9acaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "c19faeacafcd681fc1a5677088a1f984b3e431219648d433ecd05fc413f9acaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Admiration for Niagara, which is half British anyway, or enthusiasm for the \"Wild West\"— your better-class Englishman always thrills to the frontier—is no step at all toward rightly appreciating America.",
      "output_sha256": "b63ce9c6fe5af2efb5cf5a90677a4478a2e8bbfcb0e947a080cc664d5ab22d4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "b63ce9c6fe5af2efb5cf5a90677a4478a2e8bbfcb0e947a080cc664d5ab22d4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To no inconsiderable extent this is America's own fault.",
      "output_sha256": "03c623f8d56f405da0eaf5ca38c831ac0ec3c890280b8594640b435e615a5b38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "03c623f8d56f405da0eaf5ca38c831ac0ec3c890280b8594640b435e615a5b38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The nation does not present a narrative that is easily deciphered.",
      "output_sha256": "5f3a50d93ad0a6fc20a90f6af386b20e7c3a386f895cb351ad7d547be2b9cca5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.531731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "34089234ea158f76433e07126123b5769db0c0bd5538a63e79743b7e5723bac5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5f3a50d93ad0a6fc20a90f6af386b20e7c3a386f895cb351ad7d547be2b9cca5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is obvious, for instance—and so obvious that it is not often enough stated—that America has and will continue to have a fundamentally English civilization.",
      "output_sha256": "8b89b25de1bb378d058ae66369dc67d881fd6f4a0b25c55153115dd0bc45d25c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b89b25de1bb378d058ae66369dc67d881fd6f4a0b25c55153115dd0bc45d25c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "English law forms the foundation of American jurisprudence.",
      "output_sha256": "b8ec7a2b43163e9380115275cc186c46735c432a2f419c828ca31713b5673f57",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.535714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8aeecc4deb7db7f78b591345dd3ab881c61a6086d454ac5c9c7187cb60a8c9bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b8ec7a2b43163e9380115275cc186c46735c432a2f419c828ca31713b5673f57",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "English speech is her speech, and if with a difference, it is a difference that the philologist, all things considered, finds amazingly small.",
      "output_sha256": "446694fb81ecda749265abf94bc9844d11eb078399a00244f9fad08b7db70db3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "446694fb81ecda749265abf94bc9844d11eb078399a00244f9fad08b7db70db3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "English literature is her literature—Chaucer and Shakespeare hers because her blood then coursed indistinguishably through the English heart they knew so well; Milton, Dryden, and the Queen Anne men hers, because she was still a part of England; the later men hers by virtue of affectionate acquaintanceship and a generous and not inconsiderable rivalry.",
      "output_sha256": "4f8bc1a159da123a6808fd0ec40b1571b2781d4ae89f47d7e708a0ce0010d02d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f8bc1a159da123a6808fd0ec40b1571b2781d4ae89f47d7e708a0ce0010d02d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "English history, in short, is her history.",
      "output_sha256": "812d661aafd9843c31e8a561187774e179c39b863b6a599a5ef6190b490da80c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "812d661aafd9843c31e8a561187774e179c39b863b6a599a5ef6190b490da80c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The struggles of the thirteenth century through which law and parliament came into being, the struggles of the seventeenth century through which law and parliament came to rule, are America's struggles upon which she can look back with the satisfaction that some things that have been done in the world need never be undone or done over again, whatever the room for improvement may still be.",
      "output_sha256": "6721612fc1296227b877e012c85c834dada3a3c5a738c241a73103a64f27f5ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "6721612fc1296227b877e012c85c834dada3a3c5a738c241a73103a64f27f5ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Americans, no less than British, recognize that independence was largely an accidental result of a war which sprang out of a false theory of economics, but whose conclusion carried with it a lesson in the management of empire which subsequent history shows the British to have learned thoroughly and for the benefit of all concerned.",
      "output_sha256": "5fc09339e1f725dab1db5bde0b3b880c51dfba75e0abb3e4382003c13eed283e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "5fc09339e1f725dab1db5bde0b3b880c51dfba75e0abb3e4382003c13eed283e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "American independence, however, once established, pointed a way to democratic freedom which England hastened to follow.",
      "output_sha256": "be39df230c5a8f965248de536d9eaca615ed334c5682fff7247749f2a1ef4106",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "be39df230c5a8f965248de536d9eaca615ed334c5682fff7247749f2a1ef4106",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This we know.",
      "output_sha256": "aa6be021be9f143708deb172c722d9be7ae8a506f334ddc00c3fd8f200287479",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa6be021be9f143708deb172c722d9be7ae8a506f334ddc00c3fd8f200287479",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And yet—",
      "output_sha256": "d4beba87059b8b2764cee63b274c044b9aa491624c9aed4806b7a1bfcdab2cef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4beba87059b8b2764cee63b274c044b9aa491624c9aed4806b7a1bfcdab2cef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, somehow, we allow these fundamental truths to become obscured.",
      "output_sha256": "a4cd177e8f5bb89daf42d1f66f5ad39e8c620c76f5d77b5bede49638054ba6a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.630526,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62af80e639b211d0ec14c9ea5180f42da865b01d2a7625a0c7c66bd9e7cc8a5f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a4cd177e8f5bb89daf42d1f66f5ad39e8c620c76f5d77b5bede49638054ba6a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We permit the failure of England to resolve the seemingly insurmountable Irish question to foster attitudes among some Americans that are understandable for certain Irish individuals but wholly unjustifiable for any American.",
      "output_sha256": "4b91d7a6232bb57c985ecbc31e9615197c18771dde72bf803fae3ab6b897a446",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.404765,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3b9a19bf17b536fe093276750079897c44308911f882f0badfb1848d593847b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4b91d7a6232bb57c985ecbc31e9615197c18771dde72bf803fae3ab6b897a446",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We allow ourselves to be swayed by an emotional attachment to an immigrant from Eastern Europe, who arrives with a worldview shaped by circumstances long since passed in English-speaking nations, leading us to mistakenly perceive them as the embodiment of America’s foundational ideals.",
      "output_sha256": "a01910bdec14926e51c97cae73bd52d93f3d6f4e51134f41011b2b473086a925",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.425581,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "077114c2ec05bd125bb7a6bd6a82659f1c6288b3062ae67533e2eceaf887ae13"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a01910bdec14926e51c97cae73bd52d93f3d6f4e51134f41011b2b473086a925",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We too readily accept the rationale of “He is not pro-German; he simply opposes British policies.”",
      "output_sha256": "eb0344cadf02ab2e07ec115730ff3c1140038372b7a61299f33359efebbd3181",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.461635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "41afd94f6ad82f21880c7966362e097e2a56cc1edb009a55c6701e587b1a4e22"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb0344cadf02ab2e07ec115730ff3c1140038372b7a61299f33359efebbd3181",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why are they anti-British?",
      "output_sha256": "8b19fd10dd3e5c7c01b73c4d4b4d7980d799a906fa6d78317169bf59b036fa1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b19fd10dd3e5c7c01b73c4d4b4d7980d799a906fa6d78317169bf59b036fa1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why should they be permitted to make it falsely appear that recognition of the English basis of America involves approval of everything that England in her history may or may not have done?",
      "output_sha256": "b44cb4e774a2ecc3f080c765a5adcb28ca0fded0d24bc34f2cdb96d907ba7602",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "b44cb4e774a2ecc3f080c765a5adcb28ca0fded0d24bc34f2cdb96d907ba7602",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why should they be allowed to pretend that disapproval of some particular act of England justifies repudiation of most of the things by virtue of which we are what we are?",
      "output_sha256": "93e24eca7ca9df98a2d6a1ba509f80e151ebc1a2b576270435685687e279e8cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "93e24eca7ca9df98a2d6a1ba509f80e151ebc1a2b576270435685687e279e8cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "America from the first has been part of the great English experiment—great because it is capable of learning from experience.",
      "output_sha256": "36e85b59df2f777d4e41a13eb3fe523badb95134dca771cec876db6f2dd9b761",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "36e85b59df2f777d4e41a13eb3fe523badb95134dca771cec876db6f2dd9b761",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The international community has invested heavily, in terms of both blood and resources, in the education of England.",
      "output_sha256": "90f0be4761173e597c913bd25caea01217763648ad50bb9d38faaade344fe67e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.479121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6efeb4a558c1b6a297b34603d5332b9077c074fabb712792aa3b744384972392"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "90f0be4761173e597c913bd25caea01217763648ad50bb9d38faaade344fe67e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is satisfied—the world's response to Germany's insolent challenge is the proof of it—that its pains have been well bestowed.",
      "output_sha256": "a86801b6d052024ab9e22f564eed370b7a8d2f8154c03c5aa9c72aee691c7767",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "a86801b6d052024ab9e22f564eed370b7a8d2f8154c03c5aa9c72aee691c7767",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "England stands as the nation best equipped to exercise the power it possesses.",
      "output_sha256": "62e0ab97666cbce7e5261575fed28f74ef8a71bac1a30cbb15bb63bb023cf2bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.423922,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "02d6ebce71cf04fed5d60feb1c08f03d4e6d9639740085b62867cf5ad13eeca9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "62e0ab97666cbce7e5261575fed28f74ef8a71bac1a30cbb15bb63bb023cf2bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This assertion does not dismiss the unique strengths of other nations; indeed, these distinct qualities have played a vital role in shaping England’s journey.",
      "output_sha256": "f76d2db497d66aa280342407b433b7295d784376fec609a7983c217f5d6c0995",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.382477,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62c120cf6865eef907c03104946e23c261db6310ff42fe712b2fccd89439fac1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f76d2db497d66aa280342407b433b7295d784376fec609a7983c217f5d6c0995",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Italy has educated her; France has educated her; we have done something; and Germany.",
      "output_sha256": "424b9d8103b61dcf1337541749a19671271f77ac38d9eec268df9bdb70935c36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "424b9d8103b61dcf1337541749a19671271f77ac38d9eec268df9bdb70935c36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In result, she is not perfect—the English would perhaps least of all assert that—but she has learned a great deal and held herself steady while she learned it.",
      "output_sha256": "1f571b6baa1d14b9573fa3043ed823b053d4a7318d8a9220aa24b91249b571b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f571b6baa1d14b9573fa3043ed823b053d4a7318d8a9220aa24b91249b571b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is a bigger job than the world cares to undertake to teach any other nation so much.",
      "output_sha256": "b00e2eb86e44e7db27e158f0485e3b29c210a1d6d2d6ab4d3b4902286b7ac469",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "b00e2eb86e44e7db27e158f0485e3b29c210a1d6d2d6ab4d3b4902286b7ac469",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nor would it be at all likely to succeed so well.",
      "output_sha256": "aaf08be7a3006dcc3082b206c6dd5376c34853c5b31dee25807f0e5edb0c48d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "aaf08be7a3006dcc3082b206c6dd5376c34853c5b31dee25807f0e5edb0c48d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For what England has to offer the world in return is not simply her institutions; it is not merely a formula for the effective discharge of police duty throughout the world; it is the English freeman, whether he hail from Canada, Australia, Africa, or the uttermost isles of the sea.",
      "output_sha256": "16ae1f8d5247a37eb02ceb3f0b3b29695cbe7991af5033b07715a6e70083090f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "16ae1f8d5247a37eb02ceb3f0b3b29695cbe7991af5033b07715a6e70083090f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This freeman is remarkably adaptable, excelling in various roles across the globe and exhibiting an extraordinary ability to assimilate.",
      "output_sha256": "93a9f88df9da35c726a1806a21f836267df2248edcc213ddaba465f29a82b331",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.289719,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0eceea7b58cca1cab69fd39710e481ebbc3f52711b2d332127bdd9a78a80be59"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "93a9f88df9da35c726a1806a21f836267df2248edcc213ddaba465f29a82b331",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Consider him in his origins.",
      "output_sha256": "98e816ec08ae19490a1750f3500db47afc6c92684201e1f14f59125f8975d271",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "98e816ec08ae19490a1750f3500db47afc6c92684201e1f14f59125f8975d271",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He began by assimilating fully his own weight in Danes, while remaining an English freeman.",
      "output_sha256": "be9c00321bec57095e0206e88c028aaf29dc9509a653c6027d6c85fe6c722bea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "be9c00321bec57095e0206e88c028aaf29dc9509a653c6027d6c85fe6c722bea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He subsequently accepted a Norman king, just as he had with his Danish predecessor, with the hope that this ruler would not impose too many burdens upon him.",
      "output_sha256": "b208ba05e1a1aa0197d0d431601fe24e80115dc3da764d1b7c83630c0d960d2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.543685,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9ebc0374552c9d6292c392ded8da44375396f778fe452e21eb5aa89091e8676c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b208ba05e1a1aa0197d0d431601fe24e80115dc3da764d1b7c83630c0d960d2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, when the uninformed Norman William exterminated many of his natural leaders and subjugated the remainder, how did this Englishman manage, within a span of two centuries, to elevate himself and his fellow adventurers into the status of English gentlemen?",
      "output_sha256": "c35d3087b84b7fa59c53e8e4c44a317f16054f4006ebe8ff4dd9e18ae52fef88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.383624,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bae16852b03d1720593ed652766380ebde904b251cd08054fcf3a0d76f06c782"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c35d3087b84b7fa59c53e8e4c44a317f16054f4006ebe8ff4dd9e18ae52fef88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "How did he transform a motley group of exiles fleeing ecclesiastical oppression, broken younger sons, unemployed artisans, speculators, and assorted immigrants into the foundation of America?",
      "output_sha256": "16cd12ab948cf4926740ff26be80e421653c1dd5bd71f2bc644132a01f2f9f42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.48158,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d327c91d6939b0cef2bab60ffb2d754fb304ce0d23696950f1b0042a83518c43"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16cd12ab948cf4926740ff26be80e421653c1dd5bd71f2bc644132a01f2f9f42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Is he one likely to lose his bearings when in his America the age-old problem again heaves in view?",
      "output_sha256": "ae3204da2361d50eef4d1e03e230865fcc36c59595aaa7d0d7ef07e1a21bc546",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae3204da2361d50eef4d1e03e230865fcc36c59595aaa7d0d7ef07e1a21bc546",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This is a job he has been working at pretty successfully for more than a thousand years.",
      "output_sha256": "80738e56345f733d535e54e3d40e543fb2ec388400b4f8bef00988f7fe59ee06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "80738e56345f733d535e54e3d40e543fb2ec388400b4f8bef00988f7fe59ee06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Allow him the opportunity to rediscover his identity in the context of these challenges.",
      "output_sha256": "5630f3825d035484b985006c6eb446aa0dd6b2afdc168a7cf27d51ddd22e49ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.37381,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3fd95fc416be0eae8e5d2caeae5a05fefb6e9de6157b66e23a542532692c332b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5630f3825d035484b985006c6eb446aa0dd6b2afdc168a7cf27d51ddd22e49ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Don't expect him to stop and give a coherent explanation of what he is doing.",
      "output_sha256": "8d29f03d8c10bbcc79b388e2bd78f2788c96effb0bd7e915043b0157b139fe79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d29f03d8c10bbcc79b388e2bd78f2788c96effb0bd7e915043b0157b139fe79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He wouldn't be the true son of the English tradition that he is if he could do that.",
      "output_sha256": "81ebff14540f21b0b654e1a4b73225d3c13a5dc96cb4191dfa91ec381fbdbc42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "81ebff14540f21b0b654e1a4b73225d3c13a5dc96cb4191dfa91ec381fbdbc42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps the occupants of the new chair can do something of the sort for him.",
      "output_sha256": "3f015733b892846d7945bf546a50f4afe83026eea1bd8e2e6ca8109cdf5a7628",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f015733b892846d7945bf546a50f4afe83026eea1bd8e2e6ca8109cdf5a7628",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
